{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6077d460a50702fd87b27a7e70ed9ef7587ed5d54191e444775350cdd4bffcb",
      "text": "温暖的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4453bdd6e65f9f407ccd1976a5c42fe448e63f1c88e026a7b9e23efefe824a3",
      "text": "向因突降大雨而困扰的咲搭话的卷绪，\n以感冒了可不得了为由，提议她去自己\n打工的地方避雨。\n被带到Cafe Parade的咲，\n在那里遇到了幸广。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6077d460a50702fd87b27a7e70ed9ef7587ed5d54191e444775350cdd4bffcb",
      "text": "温暖的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ad8e3193c44b5703e568caa78a7f28f859b0651241e68129ce1e6279051e63c",
      "text": "那个，我是在回家的路上被雨淋了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0186356afad58bbdcd579b7dd90073ea85f24e8bfdcdd558b45fc2a6ed9e5300",
      "text": "那可真糟糕呢。\n……对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62664dbf3956b612a9e82c443c9ed6de0c3fccaebe6c888947d6330b013fd908",
      "text": "我现在正要去打工的地方。\n不介意的话，要不要跟我一起去？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e824978f22a6bfe2a9946ece3c4ee778fa452af50dd53fdc1550f852db1fb9cf",
      "text": "一直呆在这里身体会着凉的哦。\n你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79fcce1f12425a0b4814be16b2420b254449a0fa37461f9a043e3d7f83110fd3",
      "text": "可以吗？可是这孩子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:416f00512ffc38edc54ccfb6940ba132bb37d967ffb50772c41bac11c077faee",
      "text": "那就带上它一起走吧。\n这样下去，你们两个都会感冒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eeb4fcb2dbd4e1bbb88f32ade92198bb758b2acb0234b57266c16efdf022511",
      "text": "那我就恭敬不如从命，跟着你走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff9dc6d92d3b734a747b62efe9c0259c2e4ad3b8ebf02fecbccd6f431484291",
      "text": "那我们就出发吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d8ffd16313fa913ee8c43991c64e9bcb67d01a83d8d50f71ea31cea459295cb",
      "text": "（啊……为了不淋到我们，\n他把伞倾斜过来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83994cb16a2c3d0dd5fd96a674d012009fb7791b7ed3c4d14e6b242e9a316d2e",
      "text": "（对遇到困难的人能毫不犹豫地施以援手，\n既温柔又帅气呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c7ac550b8e6423a4349eaca1ed5023c35da98931d91d35e38142d4c8f2f327",
      "text": "说起来，你叫什么名字？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c6c1ffbfce626a27abe417f1b9b6fe104dc3c3c5d2271ee299af1d79612504",
      "text": "我叫……咲！水岛咲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e90c768d8c36cb3c6b4dc848c90de70f53743816d87ae8265ee10ec9a25a6048",
      "text": "我是卯月卷绪。\n请多指教啦，水岛同学！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
